  "interpretation_boundary": "Measurements apply only to the installed FabFilter Pro-C 2 2.1.7.0 VST3 Stereo instance, Default Setting, Clean style, and the exposed fixed parameters recorded above. The fixture was auto-warped by Ableton from 11.25 s to 12 s, so analysis windows reference the rendered control. Attack was the valid single-variable DSP change. The attempted Lookahead probe is negative host-integration evidence: Ableton's exposed readout reached 20.00 ms, but the plugin UI still displayed Off and the render nulled against the default at approximately the dither floor. It therefore does not establish Pro-C 2 Lookahead DSP behavior. Ableton's device status displayed 0 samples in the observed states; the separate cross-correlation estimate reports rendered timing offset and must not be conflated with host-reported latency. This test does not establish the other seven styles, oversampling, Auto Gain/Release, external sidechain, Stereo Link/M/S behavior, other sample rates/formats, or musical preference."
